{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be brave. Be smart. Don't let midnight be the end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>PAPAO: The Legend of the Bogeyman</strong>, you are a child who ignored your parents' warnings and now faces terrifying consequences. When the legendary Bogeyman visits you, he delivers a chilling ultimatum: he will return at midnight to take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With time against you, it\u2019s time to act! Your mission is twofold: stop the Bogeyman from fulfilling his promise and uncover dark secrets that tie into your own fate. Face your deepest fears as you explore the monster's mysterious lair searching for answers. Tackle eerie challenges, solve hidden mysteries, and find the strength needed to defeat the fearsome Bogeyman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your destiny is not yours alone \u2014 it\u2019s in your hands to save children worldwide. Prepare yourself for an adventure full of suspense, courage, and surprising twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/extras/7a2574caa3ad663c4640a81e154c032a.poster.avif?t=1751407966\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/extras/7a2574caa3ad663c4640a81e154c032a.webm?t=1751407966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/extras/7a2574caa3ad663c4640a81e154c032a.mp4?t=1751407966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the monster's lair and prove you\u2019re not afraid of the Bogeyman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use toys as weapons to defend yourself and overcome various challenging puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/extras/11029f040ab69e070fbc3da1fa3edbcf.avif?t=1751407966\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651710/extras_big/11029f040ab69e070fbc3da1fa3edbcf.avif?t=1751407966 width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PAPAO: The Legend of the Bogeyman</strong> offers the option to disable <strong>blood textures</strong>, specially designed for more sensitive audiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PAPAO: The Legend of the Bogeyman</strong> is a complete game, including five chapters already included. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 1: Home Sweet Home?</strong> You are home alone and receive a visit from the Boogeyman. Complete the tasks before the monster emerges from the darkness to get you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 2: Falling into Darkness!</strong> Seeking answers, our hero enters the monster\u2019s lair\u2014a themed factory that does not belong to our world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 3: Play, Work, and Don\u2019t Die!</strong> Now equipped, our hero can walk among the machines and escape from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 4: The Witch\u2019s Labyrinth</strong> Offices and ventilation ducts can be a problem, especially if something is lurking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Chapter: Who\u2019s Afraid of the Boogeyman!</strong> The ravenous monster has left a trail of destruction across the world. Now, with the help of the guardians, face it head-on and save the world!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"SHARP SHOOTER!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3651710/2e8d657df59342f5f652cc419c220781e7d86df6.jpg"},{"name":"GREAT AT HISTORY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub